btop (1.4.8-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Themes load/save by name if possible
  * Fix atomic issues and data races in btop
  * Gate Apple Silicon GPU support to unbreak intel Mac builds
  * AMD APU/iGPU sysfs backend for GPU monitoring
  * Use ISO 8601 format for log timestamps
  * Fix possible thread deadlocks and power-event-based false stall detections
  * Defer SIGWINCH resize handling
  * Fix btop with amd gpu on rocm 7 as in Ubuntu 26.04
  * Macos SIGABRT Crash during SMB TimeMachine Backups
  * Avoid macOS swap disk crash
  * Fix -/+ key binding
  * Ignore missing config dir if config file is present
  * Make background consistent in the Terminal is too small dialogue

